% holding-blocked: This original is licence-safe and fully notated, but it has not been played by students. A Grade 6 music teacher must trial the change from 3+3+3 to 2+2+2+3 and the ostinato layer at the proposed tempo; a tabla or Hindustani rhythm educator must review the listening framing and any rhythm vocabulary used in the lesson; a second score reader must check the notes.
